          "original": "XRD patterns fit well with hexagonal structure. Rietveld refinement shows Rwp = 2.56%, indicating reliable refinement results. Elemental mapping analysis reveals element homogeneity, implying successful introduction of Ge and Se into LTPS. A new Raman peak at 370 cm⁻¹ represents PS₃Se³⁻ tetrahedron, confirming partial replacement of S by Se. The actual density and tap density are estimated to be 1.82 g/cm³ and 1.19 g/cm³, respectively. It undergoes a volume change of 1.2% with six Li⁺ inserted.",
          "simplified": "Hexagonal structure confirmed by XRD (Rwp = 2.56%). Elemental homogeneity confirmed by mapping. Raman peak at 370 cm⁻¹ confirms PS₃Se³⁻ tetrahedron. Density: 1.82 g/cm³, tap density: 1.19 g/cm³. Volume change: 1.2%."
        },
